     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">פורסם במקור כאן:</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><a href=\"http://r-israel.com/2018/05/248\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-israel.com/2018/05/248&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0vdw8rRkYQFE7dMUfufCfb\">http://r-israel.com/2018/05/248</a><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;min-height:82px\"><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;min-height:82px;float:right\"><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px 10px 0px 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;float:left;display:block;line-height:1\"></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px 10px 0px 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;float:left;display:block;line-height:1\"><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;display:inline-block\"><span style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:bottom;display:inline-block;text-align:justify;width:51px;min-height:64px\"></span></div></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px 10px 0px 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;float:left;display:block;line-height:1\"><div style=\"background:transparent;border:0px none;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-indent:0px;float:none;line-height:normal;font-size:1px;display:inline-block;width:50px;min-height:24px\"></div></div></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both\"></div></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/gek8mqWk0gZ1g96x1\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/gek8mqWk0gZ1g96x1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xTMnsF9mBNMN19_raDKEC\"><em style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-style:italic\"><strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">קישור להרשמה למפגש</strong></em></a></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><p style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">אנחנו שמחים מאד להזמין אתכם למפגש R אשר יתקיים ב 28.5 (יום שני) ב 19:30 ב start hub,<span> </span><a href=\"http://starthub.co.il/\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://starthub.co.il/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0v7YE_AN05fR9zSwOygaNL\">מתחם WeWork</a><span> </span>אבן גבירול 30 תל אביב (תודה רבה לעומרי מנדלז שעזר ודחף לכך שהמפגש יתקיים).</p><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"></div></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">המפגש הזה מתקיים בזכות צירוף המקרים המשמח לפיו יהיו לנו שני משתמשי R מתקדמים (דין ויוני, ראו פירוט בהמשך) שמגיעים לבקר בישראל בעוד שבועיים, והסכימו לתת לנו הרצאות על העבודה שהם עושים ובכך מציעים לנו מספיק תוכן איכותי שאמור להחזיק מפגש שלם (עמרי ואנוכי ניתן הרצאות משלנו גם כן).</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">ההרצאות במפגש יתחילו בשעה 19:30 ויסתיימו בסביבות 22:00 (עם הפסקה של חצי שעה באמצע). במפגש יועברו 4 הרצאות (כל אחת בין 20 ל- 30 דקות, אנו צפויים לגלות מידה מסויימת של גמישות),סילבוסים מורחבים בהמשך הפוסט:</div></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"></div><ul style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 1.5em 24px 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;list-style:square;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\">What makes an R talk popular? Scraping useR2017 attendance information to find out! – Dean Attali</li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\">Sinew: Simple R Package Documentation – Yoni Sidi</li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\">Cloud computing with R – Omri Mendels</li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\">Highlights from eRum 2018 – Tal Galili</li></ul><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">ההשתתפות היא בחינם, אך <strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">דורשת הרשמה מוקדמת</strong>: עליכם להירשם בגוגל-טופס שמופיע <strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">ב<a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/gek8mqWk0gZ1g96x1\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/gek8mqWk0gZ1g96x1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xTMnsF9mBNMN19_raDKEC\">קישור הישיר כאן</a>. </strong>יש הגבלת מקום של כ- 100 איש, אז אנא <a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/gek8mqWk0gZ1g96x1\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/gek8mqWk0gZ1g96x1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xTMnsF9mBNMN19_raDKEC\">מהרו להירשם</a>. לאחר שירשמו 100 הראשונים, ישלח אליהם (כשבוע לקראת המפגש) מייל שמודיע שהם &quot;בפנים&quot;. לאחר מכן <strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">ההרשמה תישאר פתוחה ל&quot;רשימת המתנה&quot;, </strong>ובשבוע שלפני הסדנא נברר כמה אנשים לא יוכלו להגיע – ונזמין את האנשים מרשימת ההמתנה להגיע. בד&quot;כ כשליש (לפחות) מהאנשים מבטלים ברגע האחרון, אז הרבה מהאנשים של רשימת ההמתנה צפויים לקבל הזמנה להגיע <strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">(אז <a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/gek8mqWk0gZ1g96x1\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/gek8mqWk0gZ1g96x1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xTMnsF9mBNMN19_raDKEC\">תירשמו <img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/B8cb9azJm4sP1z2k_gv63Nf7Ptan5JWyozteorSEktfQHxmie4fgUY-L3tc0_MtNRFNjeJ1_0PQaUZwlyO0o8KFxGogQQ7xiS-EHbdTK9tIuJPlgRC7grLNCUMegbu8aROs_Cjip-T6f=s0-d-e1-ft#http://i0.wp.com/r-israel.com/wp-includes/images/smilies/icon_smile.gif?zoom=1.5&amp;w=640\" alt=\":)\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"background:none;border:none;margin:0px 0.07em;padding:0px;vertical-align:-0.1em;display:inline;min-height:1em;width:1em\"></a> )</strong>.</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><h3 style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em\"><strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">קהל היעד?</strong></h3><p style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\">משתמשי R עם ניסיון של יותר משנה בתוכנה (חלק מההרצאות יהיו באנגלית).</p><h3 style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em\"><strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">נושאי המפגש</strong></h3><p style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">להלן נושאי ההרצאות:</strong></p><p style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> </p></div><p style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"></span></p><h2 style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\">\r\n\r\n</h2><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;direction:ltr\"></h2><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;direction:ltr\">What makes an R talk popular? Scraping useR2017 attendance information to find out! – Dean Attali</h2>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">Last summer, the useR! conference in Belgium invited all its attendees to use a scheduling app to mark the sessions they&#39;d like to attend. Since the majority of people at the conference actually used this service and the schedule of each person was public, some interesting data regarding people&#39;s R talk preferences can be extracted. Which talks are most anticipated? Which types of session do people prefer the most? To answer these questions, the full scheduling data can be scraped with R and presented with a Shiny app to make it easy to explore.</div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">About the speaker</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/daattali\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/daattali&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27UONSL1OPM-Ed8AkiGq92\">https://github.com/daattali</a></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><br></div></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\"><span style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:1.8em\">Sinew: Simple R Package Documentation – Yoni Sidi </span></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\"><span style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:1.8em\"><br></span></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\">At the core of creating reproducible research is the daunting process of documentation, and working with R presents no exception. The standardized R package documentation is part of the appeal for new (and experienced) users, where concise, clear instructions are cherished. Packages are great for reusing scripts in a consistent fashion and for developers, package creation helps organizing and maintaining their ideas.</div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\"><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">The barrier to entry for package maintenance and documentation, however may be too high for R users embarking on the task of package creation, thereby discouraging them from development. The out-of-the-box roxygen2 skeleton supplied by RStudio gives the bare bones road map of what should be part of function documentation.</div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">The goal of sinew is to automate nearly all of the manual tasks needed to document functions, properly set up the import fields for oxygenation, and make it easier to attain documentation consistency across functions and packages.</div></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">Once the initial documentation is set, sinew can be used as part of the natural maintenance workflow to automatically change and append updated parameters, definitions, defaults, add namespacing to functions and dependencies, making your documentation great – again!</div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">About the speaker</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/yonicd/\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/yonicd/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ERiavX8T_WTyMRKFCX3ie\">https://github.com/yonicd/</a></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><br></div></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"></div><h2 style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:28.8px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;display:inline\">Cloud computing with R – Omri Mendels</span></h2><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\">We&#39;ll touch some of the tools available for R developers on Microsoft&#39;s cloud, Azure. These tools help R users to set up data science environments (notebooks, r-studio server), handle big data with Spark, run parallel processes, and run machine learning models in R.</div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\"><strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">About the speaker</strong>: Omri Mendels is a Senior Data &amp; Applied Scientist at Microsoft. In his current role he helps different companies solve interesting machine learning and data related problems. The solutions to these problems are then shared with the open source community and on Microsoft&#39;s developer blog.</div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\"></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><h2 style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;direction:ltr\">Highlights from eRum 2018 – Tal Galili</h2></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\">The <a href=\"https://2018.erum.io/\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://2018.erum.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07kqQ_-iYGI6LeCUnhGgg0\">eRum</a> (a.k.a: The European R Users Meeting) is an international conference, similar to <a href=\"https://www.r-project.org/conferences.html\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.r-project.org/conferences.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1S3LocYjDbaZSTP4Ki6Mk1\">useR!</a>, that occurs every two years (specifically, in the years in which useR is taking place outside of Europe).<span> </span><a href=\"https://www.r-statistics.com/2018/04/registration-for-erum-2018-closes-in-two-days/\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.r-statistics.com/2018/04/registration-for-erum-2018-closes-in-two-days/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39hIzGOizAkE_1gPmy11bv\">Link to the post</a><span> </span>explaining why I&#39;ll go to eRum this year and not useR.</div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;direction:ltr\">I have no idea what I&#39;ll talk about, but I suspect it would be cool.</div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"></div><div style=\"background:0px 0px rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><div style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-weight:700\">About the speaker</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/talgalili/\" style=\"background:0px 0px;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/talgalili/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1dSQR7JhmJIhFdSOKONrjy\">https://github.com/talgalili/</a></div></div></div></div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:small\">Tal Galili, Ph.D. in Statistics</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:small\"></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:small\"><br></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a><br><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0rrlY8bwyyusQD6sFK-MB1\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il/\" style=\"font-size:12.8px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw091yFjafJtMLET8PVYvY6p\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"> (Hebrew)  | </span><a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com/\" style=\"font-size:12.8px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496480471000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aZerbs3oGlf_m7YqlvNS-\">www.talgalili.com</a><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"> (Hebrew) </span><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
